`,e.jsx(i.p,{children:"The cross-chain liquidity deposit logic consists of 4 stages with all communication between the LP and the infrastructure taking place in the parent pool. The liquidity infrastructure uses the well-known concept of liquidity tokens, which represent a portion of the liquidity with fees the provider is entitled to."}),`
