`,e.jsx(i.li,{children:"Parent pool receives liquidity data and issues LP tokens in proportion to the deposit, to the liquidity provider"}),`
`,e.jsx(i.li,{children:"Parent pool initialises the liquidity distribution using Chainlink CCIP, sending an equal proportion of the deposit to each of the pools, completing the liquidity provision"}),`
